OL,3,GNEWSAPrincess of Wales drops in on arts
OL,4,Aproject in the Borders
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe princess - who is known as the
OL,7,FDuchess of Rothesay while in Scotland -
OL,8,Fgot a glimpse of the work being carried
OL,9,Fout by the group.
